     "front": "Multi-stage Docker build: the point?",
     "back": "Compile in a fat stage, ship a slim runtime — 800MB build env becomes a 15MB image."
    },
    {
     "front": "Docker layer caching rule?",
     "back": "Slow-changing instructions early (deps), fast-changing (source) late — maximize cache hits."
    },
    {
     "front": "Trunk-based vs GitFlow?",
     "back": "Trunk-based: small teams, fast cadence, short-lived branches. GitFlow: release trains, more ceremony."
    },
    {
     "front": "K8s: ConfigMap vs Secret?",
