   "summary": "Welcome to IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor for this course, and we start where every platform career starts: the DevOps toolchain, in adoption order. This is Module 1: DevOps at Cloud-Native Parity. We'll map the seven DevOps roles and their boundaries, build Linux/shell/Git fluency with real branching and PR discipline, containerize with Docker (images, layers, multi-stage builds), ship through Jenkins pipelines as code with security gates, deploy to Kubernetes, hold fleet state with Ansible, and observe it all with Prometheus, Grafana, and Loki. Every tool earns its place against a running system — the milestone arc is containerize, then pipeline, then deploy, then observe.",
