   "summary": "Welcome back to IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and this is Module 2: the Kubernetes certification stack — KCNA to CKA to CKAD to CKS. We'll climb the ladder in order: the architecture and etcd fundamentals of the KCNA/CKA tier, workloads and scheduling, services and networking, storage and the troubleshooting discipline that the CKA secretly grades; the developer-facing CKAD skills of probes, rollouts, and config; and the CKS security tier — cluster hardening, supply-chain security with image signing, and runtime defense with Falco, seccomp, and AppArmor. Every one of these exams is performance-based and practiced in live clusters, so we drill the kubectl speed that the format rewards.",
