    "title": "Platform slice: Zero-Trust Platform Architecture",
    "brief": "You will build a thin but complete slice of Zero-Trust Platform Architecture as code — provisioned, pipelined, secret-managed, cost-tagged, and torn down — because ClickOps doesn't count.",
