   "summary": "Welcome to Module 3 of IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and this module turns NIST SP 800-207 into a platform blueprint you can actually build. We'll walk the seven tenets, the policy engine / policy administrator / policy enforcement point, and the control-plane-versus-data-plane split; rebuild the perimeter around identity with phishing-resistant MFA, device posture, continuous authentication, and privileged access; design microsegmentation for the east-west traffic where lateral movement lives; and compare the three deployment models before sequencing a real migration from perimeter security. The exam tests the models; the job tests the patience — we prepare you for both.",
