   "summary": "Welcome to Module 5 of IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and we now drive the AWS certification spine, starting with the Solutions Architect Associate (SAA-C03). We'll design for failure with multi-AZ resilience and decoupled components; choose compute, storage, and databases by workload shape and cache at every layer; secure applications with IAM, KMS, security groups versus NACLs, and WAF; and optimize cost across pricing models, S3 tiers, and right-sizing. Along the way we build the Terraform reference stacks — composable VPC, ALB+ASG, RDS, and S3+CloudFront modules — so every architecture here is also infrastructure as code. SAA scenarios always hide two plausible answers; we train the constraint-first elimination the exam rewards.",
