   "summary": "Welcome to Module 6 of IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and this module is the operator's exam: the AWS Certified SysOps Administrator Associate. We'll provision with CloudFormation and ship blue/green deployments whose rollback story is the feature; design reliability and business continuity around backups, multi-AZ patterns, and Route 53 failover; run security and compliance operations with CloudTrail, Config, IAM Access Analyzer, and GuardDuty; and master the networking and cost/performance domains — VPC endpoints, CloudFront, right-sizing, and Graviton. The SysOps exam is scenario-dense: every domain is a runbook, so we drill monitor → detect → respond until it's reflex.",
