   "summary": "Welcome to Module 7 of IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and we now climb to the professional tier: the AWS Certified DevOps Engineer Professional (DOP-C02). We'll automate the SDLC with CodePipeline, canary and linear deployments, and feature flags that decouple deploy from release; manage IaC at scale with nested stacks, StackSets, and drift governance; design resilient multi-region solutions with honest data-replication thinking and chaos experiments; trace systems with CloudWatch Logs Insights and X-Ray; and run incident response and pipeline security — signed artifacts, scanning gates, least-privilege pipeline roles. It's the longest exam at 180 minutes of scenarios; we train the pace and the constraint-first elimination it demands.",
