   "summary": "Welcome to Module 8 of IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and this is the security specialty: the AWS Certified Security Specialty (SCS-C03). We'll detect and respond with GuardDuty, Detective, Security Hub, and Macie; log everything with org-wide CloudTrail, Config aggregators, and Athena forensics; lock IAM down with permission boundaries, SCPs, ABAC, and cross-account roles; protect data with KMS envelope encryption and hardened S3; and assemble the hardened landing zone — Control Tower with preventive and detective guardrails. The landing zone is the exam's favorite scenario: a new org, secure by default, compliant by construction.",
