   "summary": "Welcome to Module 9 of IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and we cross to the Azure spine, starting with administration: the AZ-104. We'll run Entra ID and RBAC — users, groups, devices, licenses, roles, scopes, least privilege, and PIM for just-in-time elevation; govern with management groups, Azure Policy, locks, and tagging; operate storage accounts with tiers, redundancy, and lifecycle management; run compute from VMs and VMSS to containers; build virtual networks with NSGs, peering, and Private Endpoints; and close with monitoring, backup, and recovery. Identity is the control plane and the exam's heaviest domain — we lab every objective on a real subscription.",
