   "summary": "Welcome to Module 10 of IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and we shift from administering Azure to designing it: the AZ-305. We'll design identity, governance, and monitoring for a multi-subscription enterprise; choose data services by workload pattern — Azure SQL, Cosmos DB with its five consistency levels, Storage, and the analytics tier; design business continuity where RTO/RPO choose between backup and Site Recovery; and design infrastructure across compute, network, and migrations. It all caps in the architecture capstone: a full design with documented trade-offs, graded on rationale — two good architects can disagree, but both must defend.",
