    },
    {
     "front": "Route TLS modes?",
     "back": "Edge (router terminates), passthrough (pod terminates), reencrypt (both)."
    },
    {
     "front": "Twelve-factor config rule?",
     "back": "Config in the environment, never in code — same image, all environments."
    },
    {
     "front": "Quarkus claim to fame?",
     "back": "Fast startup + low memory (+ native via GraalVM) — Java for serverless/scale-to-zero."
    },
