   "summary": "Welcome to Module 12 of IL-05 — Cloud DevSecOps Platform SRE. I'm your instructor, and this module covers Red Hat OpenShift both ways: as an administrator and as a developer. On the admin side — the EX280/EX380 track — we'll work containers and Kubernetes foundations, cluster administration with projects, quotas, and storage, and the day-2 operations that are the actual job: upgrades, etcd backup, and cert rotation. On the dev side — the EX188/EX288 track — we'll containerize apps, deploy with OpenShift patterns like S2I and routes, build resilient microservices, and close with the twelve-factor capstone on Quarkus. These are performance exams on live clusters — speed with `oc` is the skill.",
